rules.bad_example:
# Project Memory

@import ./CLAUDE.md

This file imports itself, creating a circular dependency.

rules.good_example:
# Project Memory

@import ./docs/guidelines.md

Keep import chains shallow.

rules.bad_example:
# Project Memory

@import ./level1.md

This starts a chain: level1 -> level2 -> level3 -> level4 -> level5 -> level6 (exceeds depth 5).

rules.good_example:
@AGENTS.md

## Claude Code
Use plan mode for changes under src/billing/.

{
  "spinnerTipsOverride": {
    "label": "Acme tip",
    "tips": [
      "Run /review before opening a PR",
